  "review": "**Verdict: conditional pass for the scoped opening beta only, based on the evidence as reported; I have not independently verified it.**\n\nOverlap (166/523 to 0/720), zero visibility across all 16 pairings, and unchanged rules, protocol and solo checks support the change.\n\n**Limits:**\n- Local and public WebRTC regression must pass before wider release.\n- Cross-WAN behaviour and subjective player review are unverified.\n- Overlap evidence covers only host plus seven bots in the first 8s.\n- Lateral spread is confirmed for round 1 only.\n- \"No stalls\" holds only at sample times.\n- The 51.75m vs 49.875m path gap (about 3.8%) needs win-rate monitoring.\n- Confirm no discarded producer output remains.",
